OL,3,GNEWSAHospital maternity services
OL,4,Aupgraded to 'good'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has seen its rating for
OL,7,Fmaternity services raised from
OL,8,F"requires improvement" to "good".
OL,10,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,11,Fupgraded the rating for Northampton
OL,12,FGeneral Hospital, following an
OL,13,Finspection in March.
OL,15,FThe CQC upgraded ratings for safety and
OL,16,Fleadership from "requires improvement"
OL,17,Fto "good," while effectiveness, care
OL,18,Fand responsiveness were also rated
OL,19,F"good".
